<title>SWEDEN: Stockholm to lift Skandia, Stadshypotek suspension.</title>
<headline>Stockholm to lift Skandia, Stadshypotek suspension.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stockholm Bourse said it will lift a suspension in trading of shares of Skandia and Stadshypotek at 1345 GMT.  </p>
<p>The bourse suspended trading in the two shares before opening on Monday, pending an announcement that the two planned to merge.</p>
<p>Sweden's Finance Ministry, which is handling the sale of a state 34 percent shareholding in Stadshypotek, issued a statement on Monday criticisng the proposed merger.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1004</p>
</text>
